    Finds the first non-negative integer pair (x, y) with the smallest x that satisfies ax + by = n.
    If no such solution exists, returns the string "No solution".

    Parameters:
    a (int): coefficient of x
    b (int): coefficient of y
    n (int): the right-hand side constant

    Returns:
    Tuple[int, int]: the first valid (x, y) pair with x, y >= 0 and smallest x
    or
    str: "No solution" if no valid non-negative integer solution exists
