    """Return the number of times the digit 7 appears in integers which are divisible by 11 or 13,
    considering integers from 1 up to but not including n.

    >>> fizz_buzz(50)
    0
    >>> fizz_buzz(78)
    2
    >>> fizz_buzz(79)
    3
    """
